Download and install JDK

Examples:
- jabba install 1.8
- jabba install ~1.8.73 # same as ">=1.8.73 <1.9.0"
- jabba install 1.8.73=dmg+http://.../jdk-9-ea+110_osx-x64_bin.dmg

Usage: jabba install [OPTIONS] <VERSION>

Arguments:
  <VERSION>
          The version to install

Options:
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>
          Custom destination (if outside of $JABBA_HOME/jdk then it's considered unmanaged, i.e.e not available to jabba ls, use, etc.. unless jabba linked)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
